  "governance_contracts_note": [
    "`docs/contracts/` defaults to `consumer` because most contracts on that page",
    "describe behaviour the package promises an installing consumer -- classifying the",
    "whole directory as governance would systematically undercount shipped work.",
    "The files listed above are the exceptions: contracts that govern this",
    "repository's own process (decision recording, council, release cutting, CI",
    "floors, evidence discipline) rather than promised behaviour. They resolve to",
    "`governance`. A contract absent from this list and absent from the tree is a",
    "stale entry and is reported by `--audit`."
  ]
